, "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-025": {"description": "Run the skills-index suite; INDEX.csv regenerates from the SKILL.md frontmatter.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-025.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-025)", "title": "verifies SR-025;LLR-025", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-026": {"description": "Run the agent-loop suite; the dispatcher and its workers resume headless (registry + reservations + explicit assignments) without blocking on any prompt; a no-{prompt} CmdTemplate delivers its prompt on stdin (build_argv/run_session), a large prompt surviving untruncated.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-026.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-026)", "title": "verifies SR-026;LLR-026", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-027": {"description": "Run the agent-loop suite; preflight exits a typed code on a non-git dir / missing CLI / private author.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-027.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-027)", "title": "verifies SR-027;LLR-027", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-028": {"description": "Run the agent-loop suite; a zero-commit repo is guarded and an all-ERROR region reads as an unavailable agent.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-028.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-028)", "title": "verifies SR-028;LLR-028", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-029": {"description": "Run the agent-loop suite's lock tests (ported from the retired tracks suite): a hard-exited holder's kernel lock is OS-released and the next run acquires it cleanly.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-029.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-029)", "title": "verifies SR-029;LLR-029", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-030": {"description": "Run the agent-loop suite's lock tests (ported from the retired tracks suite): a second coordinator on a held lock is refused cross-process; a contention errno refuses; an unlockable filesystem degrades warn-only.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-030.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-030)", "title": "verifies SR-030;LLR-030", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-031": {"description": "Run the process-config and policy suites: every enforcer reads one value per dial from docs/process.toml, the hooks' sh and tomllib agree over the adversarial shape table, and a mixed config is refused.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-031.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-031)", "title": "verifies SR-031;LLR-031", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-032": {"description": "Run the onboard/dev-setup suite; the scaffolded scripts run to a green setup and dev-setup wires the pre-commit floor (core.hooksPath).", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-032.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-032)", "title": "verifies SR-032;LLR-032;SR-113;LLR-122", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-033": {"description": "Run gen_release_checklist.py over a warn-tier PB budget; assert the generated checklist lists the budget id and its allocation.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-033.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-033)", "title": "verifies SR-033;LLR-033", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-034": {"description": "Run the dependency-ledger suite; an AST scan asserts every kit script's top-level imports resolve to stdlib, a local sibling, or a Kind=python row in docs/dependencies.md, and the scanner is driven over a fixture tree with a genuinely undeclared import to prove it catches one.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-034.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-034)", "title": "verifies SR-034", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-035": {"description": "Analyze the CI matrix result across Linux/Windows/macOS x Python 3.11/latest.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-035.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-035)", "title": "verifies SR-035;SR-114", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-036": {"description": "Inspect a re-sync done per ADOPTING.md section 6 against the docs/kit-version diff — kit-owned taken wholesale, generated docs regenerated, filled-in files preserved. Process doc + downstream-resync skill; no automated test.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-036.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-036)", "title": "verifies SR-036", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-037": {"description": "Run WI id, predecessor, cycle, placeholder, absent-registry, and opt-out validation cases.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-037.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-037)", "title": "verifies SR-067;LLR-034", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-038": {"description": "Generate the core offline dashboard and inspect completeness, spine hierarchy, and roadmap output.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-038.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-038)", "title": "verifies SR-070;LLR-035", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-039": {"description": "Run the check-dupes suite; a seeded copy-pasted helper fails naming both file:line locations (one merged finding), clean source passes, the threshold is tunable, in-block repetition does not self-report, a fingerprint+pair census line suppresses that block while a NEW distinct block in the same listed pair still fails, a same-line separate-block interior edit defeats a stale census, --emit-census round-trips to green, a legacy bare pair still coarsely suppresses, and unallowed() is count-aware.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-039.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-039)", "title": "verifies SR-039;LLR-036", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-040": {"description": "Run the agent-loop suite; a REVIEW-B-mapped phase invokes the second fake CLI and not the default, a broken map entry exits preflight naming the phase, the banner carries review-policy, and a bloated status.md warns without blocking.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-040.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-040)", "title": "verifies SR-040;LLR-037", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-041": {"description": "Run the doc-refs suite; a dangling path warns then gates under --strict, non-path backticks/URLs/globs pass, a path-ok line is exempt, a dangling or unknown-module sym: is flagged, and the symbol tier skips cleanly without an inventory.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-041.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-041)", "title": "verifies SR-041;LLR-038", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-042": {"description": "Run the gen-okf suite; typed linked concepts generate, Process Guide concepts emit for present docs with derived summaries and unmodified sources (and none on a vacuous scaffold), regeneration is byte-stable, --check trips on registry/doc edits/extras and recovers after regen, extras are pruned, placeholder-only is vacuous, off silences, and the okf step is wired at G3.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-042.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-042)", "title": "verifies SR-042;LLR-039", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-043": {"description": "Run the subagent-gate suite; a Task/Agent spawn under deny is refused (permissionDecision=deny, exit 2), under ask defers, off/absent and the SUBAGENT_GATE=allow override allow it, a non-spawn tool is not gated, and a malformed payload fails open (allow) with a log line.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-043.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-043)", "title": "verifies SR-043;LLR-040", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-044": {"description": "Run IF id, SR back-link, Component membership, and endpoint-advisory trace cases.", "fill": "#0f766e", "href": "docs/okf/test-cases/TC-044.md", "resource": "docs/test/test-cases.csv (TC-044)", "title": "verifies SR-073;LLR-041", "type": "Test Case"}, "TC-045": {"description": "Run the skills-sync suite: a hand-edited per-agent copy fails gen_skills_index --check-agents, bootstrap --sync restores byte-identity, a repo with