ements/interfaces.csv (IF-022)", "title": "IF-022", "type": "Interface"}, "IF-023": {"description": "reads the WI registry - the docs/work/ spec folder, the one home since Phase 5 (a stray legacy work-items.csv is its own integrity finding) - (ids/predecessors/status/Deliverable/SpecRef) and cross-reads docs/status.md, docs/architecture.md, docs/stack.ini and interfaces.csv for the SSOT + connectivity coverage; also reads the `## Interfaces` section of the doc", "fill": "#701a75", "href": "docs/okf/interfaces/IF-023.md", "resource": "docs/requirements/interfaces.csv (IF-023)", "title": "IF-023", "type": "Interface"}, "IF-024": {"description": "reads the WI registry (the docs/work/ spec folder, the one home since Phase 5) for the roadmap DAG and docs/architecture.md's generated MODULE MAP block for the How-SW module/graph view (WI-280: the registry read stays in the facade's main(); the MODULE MAP parse is traj_parse.sw_modules, re-exported — the seam surface is unchanged)", "fill": "#701a75", "href": "docs/okf/interfaces/IF-024.md", "resource": "docs/requirements/interfaces.csv (IF-024)", "title": "IF-024", "type": "Interface"}, "IF-025": {"description": "walks the Python source tree (AST) for the symbol map + internal-import diagram and reads interfaces.csv to merge the IF-### seam edges", "fill": "#701a75", "href": "docs/okf/interfaces/IF-025.md", "resource": "docs/requirements/interfaces.csv (IF-025)", "title": "IF-025", "type": "Interface"}, "IF-026": {"description": "parses each *.py under the declared src root (AST) for stub-bodied public symbols at the gate", "fill": "#701a75", "href": "docs/okf/interfaces/IF-026.md", "resource": "docs/requirements/interfaces.csv (IF-026)", "title": "IF-026", "type": "Interface"}, "IF-027": {"description": "tokenizes each source file (stdlib tokenize) and slides the --min-tokens window across the set; reads docs/dupes-allow (the fingerprint+pair census)", "fill": "#701a75", "href": "docs/okf/interfaces/IF-027.md", "resource": "docs/requirements/interfaces.csv (IF-027)", "title": "IF-027", "type": "Interface"}, "IF-028": {"description": "reads the generated MODULE MAP block as the symbol oracle and scans root + docs/*.md for dangling path / sym: references", "fill": "#701a75", "href": "docs/okf/interfaces/IF-028.md", "resource": "docs/requirements/interfaces.csv (IF-028)", "title": "IF-028", "type": "Interface"}, "IF-029": {"description": "reads the Runtime flows section (mermaid sequence blocks) and the registries to validate the authored flow ids", "fill": "#701a75", "href": "docs/okf/interfaces/IF-029.md", "resource": "docs/requirements/interfaces.csv (IF-029)", "title": "IF-029", "type": "Interface"}, "IF-030": {"description": "reads root *.md + docs/**/*.md for the link graph, the PROJECT-VISION tag, the SN inventory, and generated-doc staleness under --stale", "fill": "#701a75", "href": "docs/okf/interfaces/IF-030.md", "resource": "docs/requirements/interfaces.csv (IF-030)", "title": "IF-030", "type": "Interface"}, "IF-031": {"description": "reads the PB-### budgets registry and a measured-metrics JSON, comparing each in-tier metric to its budget/baseline", "fill": "#701a75", "href": "docs/okf/interfaces/IF-031.md", "resource": "docs/requirements/interfaces.csv (IF-031)", "title": "IF-031", "type": "Interface"}, "IF-032": {"description": "reads the staged diff / commit message / outgoing range via git and docs/privacy-check + docs/secrets-scan for the active leak classes", "fill": "#701a75", "href": "docs/okf/interfaces/IF-032.md", "resource": "docs/requirements/interfaces.csv (IF-032)", "title": "IF-032", "type": "Interface"}, "IF-033": {"description": "reads the spine registries and the present process docs to emit the docs/okf typed-concept bundle", "fill": "#701a75", "href": "docs/okf/interfaces/IF-033.md", "resource": "docs/requirements/interfaces.csv (IF-033)", "title": "IF-033", "type": "Interface"}, "IF-034": {"description": "reads the SN core-needs table and the PB budgets