 <p class="cap">One work item, once around the loop: claimed off the ready frontier onto its own lane, built by one worker session, closed into a terminal outcome, refreshed against trunk, and merged through the serial slot — the intake mint then feeds the registry back to the dispatcher. The full contract is <a href="project-trajectory/PROCESS_OPTIONS.md">project-trajectory/PROCESS_OPTIONS.md</a> “Unattended operation” · “Parallel work”.</p>
