rker-end="url(#stnarrow)"/></g><g class="stbarrier"><title>The spine barrier — an exclusive-kind row (spine · adjudication · attestation · gate · protected · high-risk) stops new admission; the lanes drain; the batch runs alone as the sole toucher of trunk.</title><rect class="stbar" x="288.5" y="58.0" width="3.5" height="24.0"/><rect class="stbar" x="296.5" y="58.0" width="3.5" height="24.0"/><text class="stbarlab" x="294.0" y="96.0" text-anchor="middle">spine barrier</text></g><text class="stprop" x="450.0" y="238.0" text-anchor="middle">every lane ends in a merge</text><text class="stprop2" x="450.0" y="256.0" text-anchor="middle">cancelled · merged · partial — a branch never hangs</text><text class="stlab" x="600.0" y="505.0" text-anchor="middle">lost race → refresh again</text><a href="project-trajectory/PROCESS_OPTIONS.md" class="stg" data-node="st-tick"><title>Dispatcher tick — frontier → admission by kind · exclusive row ⇒ the barrier</title><rect x="62.0" y="39.0" width="176.0" height="62.0" rx="8"/><text x="150.0" y="70.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan class="stgt" x="150.0" dy="-12">Dispatcher tick</tspan><tspan class="stgn" x="150.0" dy="14">frontier → admission by kind</tspan><tspan class="stgn" x="150.0" dy="12">exclusive row ⇒ the barrier</tspan></text></a><a href="docs/work" class="stg" data-node="st-claim"><title>Claim — serial trunk commit · branch cut · specs → active/&lt;branch&gt;/</title><rect x="362.0" y="39.0" width="176.0" height="62.0" rx="8"/><text x="450.0" y="70.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan class="stgt" x="450.0" dy="-12">Claim</tspan><tspan class="stgn" x="450.0" dy="14">serial trunk commit · branch cut</tspan><tspan class="stgn" x="450.0" dy="12">specs → active/&lt;branch&gt;/</tspan></text></a><rect class="stshadow" x="678.0" y="55.0" width="176.0" height="62.0" rx="8"/><rect class="stshadow" x="670.0" y="47.0" width="176.0" height="62.0" rx="8"/><a href="docs/log.md" class="stg" data-node="st-build"><title>Lane build — one worker session per lane · own worktree · parallel lanes</title><rect x="662.0" y="39.0" width="176.0" height="62.0" rx="8"/><text x="750.0" y="70.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan class="stgt" x="750.0" dy="-12">Lane build</tspan><tspan class="stgn" x="750.0" dy="14">one worker session per lane</tspan><tspan class="stgn" x="750.0" dy="12">own worktree · parallel lanes</tspan></text></a><a href="docs/work/cancelled" class="stg" data-node="st-cancelled"><title>cancelled — specs → cancelled/</title><rect x="666.0" y="153.0" width="168.0" height="44.0" rx="8"/><text x="750.0" y="175.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan class="stgt" x="750.0" dy="-2">cancelled</tspan><tspan class="stgn" x="750.0" dy="14">specs → cancelled/</tspan></text></a><a href="docs/work/complete" class="stg" data-node="st-merged"><title>merged — specs → complete/</title><rect x="666.0" y="223.0" width="168.0" height="44.0" rx="8"/><text x="750.0" y="245.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan class="stgt" x="750.0" dy="-2">merged</tspan><tspan class="stgn" x="750.0" dy="14">specs → complete/</tspan></text></a><a href="docs/work/partial" class="stg" data-node="st-partial"><title>partial — specs → partial/</title><rect x="666.0" y="293.0" width="168.0" height="44.0" rx="8"/><text x="750.0" y="315.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan class="stgt" x="750.0" dy="-2">partial</tspan><tspan class="stgn" x="750.0" dy="14">specs → partial/</tspan></text></a><a href="project-trajectory/PROCESS_OPTIONS.md" class="stg" data-node="st-refresh"><title>Station refresh — merge trunk in · trunk_step · bar · green ⇒ Bar-Green @ branch tip</title><rect x="662.0" y="389.0" width="176.0" height="62.0" rx="8"/><text x="750.0" y="420.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan class="stgt" x="750.0" dy="-12">Station refresh</tspan><tspan class="stgn" x="750.0" dy="14">merge trunk in · trunk_step · bar</tspan><tspan class="stgn" x="750.0" dy="12">green ⇒ Bar-Green @ branch tip</tspan></text></a><g class="slot" data-node="st-slot"><title>The merge slot — the exclusive turn to advance trunk. Serial and sub-second: the bar runs outside it, the slot only re-checks ancestry and merges.</title><rect x="362.0" y="389.0" width="176.0" height="62.0" rx="12"/><text x="450.0" y="420.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan class="slotname" x="450.0" dy="-12">Merge slot</tspan><tspan class="slotsub" x="450.0" dy="15">serial · one branch at a time</tspan><tspan class="slotsub" x="450.0" dy="12">ancestor check → --no-ff merge</tspan></text></g><a href="docs/log.md" class="stg" data-node="st-advance"><title>Trunk advance — ff trunk to the barred tree · unload the lane worktree</title><rect x="62.0" y="389.0" width="176.0" height="62.0" rx="8"/><text x="150.0" y="420.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan class="stgt" x="150.0" dy="-12">Trunk advance</tspan><tspan class="stgn" x="150.0" dy="14">ff trunk to the barred tree</tspan><tspan class="stgn" x="150.0" dy="12">unload the lane worktree</tspan></text></a><a href="docs/work" class="stg" data-node="st-intake"><title>Intake mint — new rows at the landed merge: · amendment · disposition · drafts</title><rect x="62.0" y="214.0" width="176.0" height="62.0" rx="8"/><text x="150.0" y="245.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan class="stgt" x="150.0" dy="-12">Intake mint</tspan><tspan class="stgn" x="150.0" dy="14">new rows at the landed merge:</tspan><tspan class="stgn" x="150.0" dy="12">amendment · disposition · drafts</tspan></text></a></svg></div>
