s/secrets-scan</del><ins>and</ins><span class="eq"> </span><del>off</del><ins>the</ins><span class="eq"> </span><del>declaration,</del><ins>expensive</ins><span class="eq"> </span><del>not</del><ins>one is any moment after. Folding the scan into</ins><span class="eq"> the privacy toggle </span><del>(IMPROVEMENT_PLAN.md</del><ins>was</ins><span class="eq"> </span><del>Threads</del><ins>rejected:</ins><span class="eq"> </span><del>38/39/44/46).</del><ins>that makes the highest-severity check opt-in alongside a preference. The one opt-out is an explicit declaration, so turning it off is a visible act.</ins></div><div class="cellname">AcceptanceCriteria <span class="pill">9% of the words changed</span></div><div class="diff"><span class="eq">A staged PEM header, token, or key pattern is flagged and blocks; a clean diff passes; the floor runs with privacy-check off, and is disabled only by an explicit </span><del>docs/secrets-scan:</del><ins>secrets_scan</ins><span class="eq"> </span><del>off.</del><ins>= false.</ins></div><div class="ctx"><div class="ctxhead">the rest of this SR — unchanged since the baseline</div><div class="field"><span class="k">SR-ID</span><span class="v">SR-017</span></div><div class="field"><span class="k">Title</span><span class="v">Always-on secrets floor</span></div><div class="field"><span class="k">SN-Refs</span><span class="v">SN-009</span></div><div class="field"><span class="k">Priority</span><span class="v">M</span></div><div class="field"><span class="k">Verification</span><span class="v">Test</span></div><div class="field"><span class="k">Status</span><span class="v">Modified</span></div><div class="field"><span class="k">Phase</span><span class="v">1</span></div><div class="field"><span class="k">Area</span><span class="v">Secrets + privacy lint</span></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="row-head"><span class="rid">LLR LLR-017</span><span class="pill">changed</span></div><div class="cellname">TestRefs <span class="pill">50% o