-LLR-036,SR-039,Duplicate-block detector,project-trajectory/scripts/check_dupes.py,find_duplicates/fingerprint/unallowed,"Tokenizes each source file (stdlib tokenize; comments/NL/indent excluded, NEWLINE kept so windows cannot stitch unrelated statements), slides a --min-tokens window (default 30), groups candidate hits by line offset, and merges only step-1-overlapping token-window offsets into one finding per block, POSIX-normalizes the file pair, and fingerprints each block (a hash of its complete token signature, line-number-free). A finding is suppressed only when its fingerprint+pair is recorded in docs/dupes-allow (count-aware: N lines sanction N identical copies) or a legacy bare pair matches; --emit-census prints the lines.",,(see TC-039),Verified,CMP-003,1
